OL,3,GNEWSACall for long-term antisocial
OL,4,Abehaviour fixes
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong-term solutions are needed to
OL,7,Ftackle antisocial behaviour in
OL,8,FLincolnshire, according to a local
OL,9,Fcouncillor.
OL,11,FReform UK's Robbie Woods at
OL,12,FLincolnshire County Council said
OL,13,Freports of stones and eggs being thrown
OL,14,Fat people and properties in Sutton
OL,15,FBridge last week were "completely
OL,16,Funacceptable", but stressed that not
OL,17,Fall young people should be blamed.
OL,19,FWoods said dangerous antisocial
OL,20,Fbehaviour needed to be dealt with, but
OL,21,Finvestment in opportunities for young
OL,22,Fpeople was also needed.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
